--- 原说明 ---
The "evaluation of `F` at `X`" functor,
as a functor `C × (C ⥤ D) ⥤ D`.
-/
def evaluationUncurried : C × (C ⥤ D) ⥤ D where
  obj p := p.2.obj p.1
  map := fun {x} {y} f => x.2.map f.1 ≫ f.2.app y.1

